nodecode-doctrine is a rewrite of percyhendrux123-prog's percyhendrux123-prog/hermes-axiom-agent:

  https://github.com/percyhendrux123-prog/hermes-axiom-agent
  commit 1861b7820d5866e36b07dc54bb647f9eefa94bd5

